    },
    "expected": {"subagents": [{"sessionId": "agent-x", "parentSessionId": null, "workflowRunId": null, "agentDescription": "Review billing", "workflowPhase": "Implement", "logs": [{"uuid": "x1"}, {"uuid": "x2"}]}]},
    "note": "Rule 3a: null append meta never clears a stored value: x2 is appended, 'Review billing' and 'Implement' are kept. Copying the append's meta as-is would set both to null."
  },
